  "description": "It was discovered that GStreamer Bad Plugins incorrectly validated the size\nof multi-channel audio blocks. An attacker could possibly use this  issue\nwith a specially crafted WAV file to cause the program to crash, resulting\nin a denial of service, or possibly execute arbitrary code.",
